{"words": [{"text": "فَالِقُ", "translation": "(He is the) Cleaver"}, {"text": "ٱلْإِصْبَاحِ", "translation": "(of) the daybreak"}, {"text": "وَجَعَلَ", "translation": "and He has made"}, {"text": "ٱلَّيْلَ", "translation": "the night"}, {"text": "سَكَنًۭا", "translation": "(for) rest"}, {"text": "وَٱلشَّمْسَ", "translation": "and the sun"}, {"text": "وَٱلْقَمَرَ", "translation": "and the moon"}, {"text": "حُسْبَانًۭا ۚ", "translation": "(for) reckoning"}, {"text": "ذَٰلِكَ", "translation": "That"}, {"text": "تَقْدِيرُ", "translation": "(is the) ordaining"}, {"text": "ٱلْعَزِيزِ", "translation": "(of) the All-Mighty"}, {"text": "ٱلْعَلِيمِ", "translation": "the All-Knowing"}], "sahih": "[He is] the cleaver of daybreak and has made the night for rest and the sun and moon for calculation.1 That is the determination of the Exalted in Might, the Knowing."}